OL,3,GNEWSANan's memoir casts light on town's
OL,4,A'pioneers'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA granddaughter has said sharing her
OL,7,Fnan's memoir with the community would
OL,8,Fbe an honour, but her grandmother would
OL,9,Fnot have been phased.
OL,11,FAt the age of 85, Blanche Madden put
OL,12,Fdown her memories of her's family move
OL,13,Fto Billingham in 1928 to work in the
OL,14,Fthen newly opened ICI Anhydrite Mine.
OL,16,FIt was written for her granddaughter
OL,17,FAlison Newton, who will read out some
OL,18,Fof the work during an event at St
OL,19,FCuthbert's Church across the weekend.
OL,20,FThere are also hopes to turn the
OL,21,Fmemoirs into a theatre performance.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
